# 🌟 Project Overview

A rapidly growing ride-booking company is generating massive amounts of operational and customer data every day. While the business continues to expand across multiple vehicle categories and payment platforms, several operational challenges have started impacting efficiency and customer satisfaction.

The company wants to leverage **SQL Analytics** and **Power BI Dashboards** to uncover meaningful insights from ride-booking data and improve strategic decision-making.

---

# 🎯 Business Goals

✅ Improve customer experience
✅ Reduce ride cancellations
✅ Monitor driver performance
✅ Track revenue growth
✅ Analyze booking trends
✅ Optimize operational efficiency
✅ Build interactive business dashboards

